@host = http://localhost:5102

### 1. History, first page
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/1/transactions?pageSize=10

### 1. History, next page (use nextBeforeDate / nextBeforeId from the previous response)
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/1/transactions?pageSize=10&beforeDate=2026-10-01T00:00:00&beforeId=100000

### 2. Customer overview - one SQL statement, check the console
GET {{host}}/api/customers/1/overview

### 3. Monthly volume, LINQ
GET {{host}}/api/reports/monthly-volume/2026

### 3b. Monthly volume, raw SQL
GET {{host}}/api/reports/monthly-volume/2026/sql

### 4. Top spenders, last 30 days
GET {{host}}/api/reports/top-customers?top=10

### 5. Compiled query
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/lookup/1000000005

### 6. Split query
GET {{host}}/api/customers/by-state/Lagos?take=5

### 7. Bulk update
POST {{host}}/api/maintenance/fail-stale-pending?olderThanHours=24
